The `open_item` machine's `clarify` edges: an open item addressed by its absolute path moves to
`clarify` when it asks the user, and back to `open` once answered; neither edge runs a hook.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/open-items/OI-0001.md --
---
id: OI-0001
title: "t"
status: open
---

# t
-- cmd --
sh -c 'booping playbook-transition specs clarify --state open_item --target "$PWD/vault/open-items/OI-0001.md" && booping playbook-transition specs open --state open_item --target "$PWD/vault/open-items/OI-0001.md"'
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
open → clarify
frontmatter: status=clarify
clarify → open
frontmatter: status=open
-- stderr --
-- expected/cwd/vault/open-items/OI-0001.md --
---
id: OI-0001
title: "t"
status: open
---

# t
